# Subject data now lives outside the repo, at ~/Documents/JulieData/<Subject>/,
# so it needs no ignore rules of its own -- git only sees inside this repo.
# A gitignore pattern cannot reach outside the repository (a leading ../ never
# matches), so these entries only guard against a data directory reappearing
# in the working tree, e.g. after checking out a commit that predates 2975202.
Cortana/
Bixby/
